# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is shipped to the browser in plain text.
# If it must stay secret, it must not carry that prefix — and it must only be
# read in server code.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Supabase (ADR-0007). URL and publishable key are safe to expose — access is
# enforced by row-level security, not by keeping these secret. The service role
# key bypasses RLS entirely and must NEVER carry the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix or be
# used outside server-only code (lib/db/ only).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
